#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:44
msgid "ht://dig"
msgstr "ht://dig"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:53
msgid ""
"The fulltext search feature makes use of the ht://dig HTML search engine. "
"You can get ht://dig at the"
msgstr "Fùltekstowô szëkba brëkùjë mòtóra ht://dig. Mòżesz gò dobëc z"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:59
msgid "Information about where to get the ht://dig package."
msgstr "Wédowiédzô ò tim skądka mòże dobëc paczét ht://dig."

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:63
msgid "ht://dig home page"
msgstr "ht://dig domôcô starna"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:69
msgid "Program Locations"
msgstr "Pòłożenié programów"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:78
msgid "ht&dig"
msgstr "ht&dig"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:83
msgid "Enter the path to your htdig program here, e.g. /usr/local/bin/htdig"
msgstr "Wpiszë stegnã do programë htdig, np., /usr/local/bin/htdig"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:88
msgid "ht&search"
msgstr "ht&search"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:93
msgid ""
"Enter the path to your htsearch program here, e.g. /usr/local/bin/htsearch"
msgstr "Wpiszë stegnã do programë htsearch, np., /usr/local/bin/htsearch"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:98
msgid "ht&merge"
msgstr "ht&merge"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:103
msgid ""
"Enter the path to your htmerge program here, e.g. /usr/local/bin/htmerge"
msgstr "Wpiszë stegnã do programë n.p. /usr/local/bin/htmerge"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:109
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "Òbjim"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:111
msgid ""
"Here you can select which parts of the documentation should be included in "
"the fulltext search index. Available options are the KDE Help pages, the "
"installed man pages, and the installed info pages. You can select any number "
"of these."
msgstr ""
"Mòże wëbrac chtërné dzéle dokùmentacëji mają bëc włączoné do fùltekstowégò "
"indeksowaniô szëkbë. Mòżlëwé òptacëje to starnë pòmòcë KDE, winstalowóné "
"starnë pòdrãcznika (man) ë winstalowóné starnë wëdowiédzë (info). Mòżë "
"wëbrac swòjowólną ich wielënã."

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:118
msgid "&KDE help"
msgstr "Pòmòc &KDE"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:122
msgid "&Man pages"
msgstr "Starnë pòdrãcznika (&man)"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:127
msgid "&Info pages"
msgstr "Starnë wëdowiédzë (&info)"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:132
msgid "Additional Search Paths"
msgstr "Dodôwné stegnë szëkbë"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:134
msgid ""
"Here you can add additional paths to search for documentation. To add a "
"path, click on the <em>Add...</em> button and select the folder from where "
"additional documentation should be searched. You can remove folders by "
"clicking on the <em>Delete</em> button."
msgstr ""
"Mòże dodac dodôwné stegnë do dokùmentacëji. Abë dodac stegnã, klëkni na "
"knąpã <em>Dodôj</em> ë wëbierzë katalog z dodôwną dokùmentacëją. Katalodżi "
"mòże rëmac knąpą <em>Rëmôj</em>."

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:141
msgid "Add..."
msgstr "Dodôj..."

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:144
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Rëmôj"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:151
msgid "Language Settings"
msgstr "Jãzëkòwé nastôwë"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:153
msgid "Here you can select the language you want to create the index for."
msgstr "Tuwò mòże wëbrac jãzëk dlô chtërnegò chcesz ùsôdzëc indeks."

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:155
msgid "&Language"
msgstr "&Jãzëk"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:171
msgid "Generate Index..."
msgstr "Generëjë indeks..."

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:172
msgid "Click this button to generate the index for the fulltext search."
msgstr "Klëkni na nã knąpã abë wëgenerowac indeks fùltekstowi szëkbë."

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:202
msgid "without name"
msgstr "bez miona"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:216
msgid ""
"<h1>Help Index</h1> This configuration module lets you configure the ht://"
"dig engine which can be used for fulltext search in the KDE documentation as "
"well as other system documentation like man and info pages."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Indeks pòmòcë</h1> Kònfigùracjowi mòdul zezwôlô skònfigùrowac mòtór ht://"
"dig, chtëren bãdze szło brëkòwac do fùltekstowi szëkbë w dokùmentacëji  KDE "
"ë systemòwi dokùmentacëji jakno starnë pòdrãcznika abò wëdowiédzë."
